      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer complaint on discount denial/service
Frequency: Event-driven; ~20–50 complaints/year
Volume: All stores
Owner: Customer Service Lead
Participants: Customer Service, Store Manager, Compliance, Legal
Source: workflow W2904 — Customer Complaint &amp; DTI/NCSC Escalation Handling</bpmn:documentation>
